                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Through the 2026 crisis diesel's error ran about seven times its calm-week level — not double, as the 13-year regime averages suggest. The model still led the naive benchmark throughout: a crisis does not make it less useful than the alternative, it makes precision unavailable to anybody.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1a1a1a"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Cards average the rolling 26-week columns across the weeks you have selected, so the MAE pair will not reproduce Skill by division — the mean of ratios is not the ratio of means.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#6b7280"
                    }
